{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armaments crafted for heroes and villains forged by destiny: Meiko, Ardeos, and Sylvie. Three unique armor and weapon cosmetics, one for each associated Hero, and a ferocious spirit mount that can be ridden by any Hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Supporter Pack is for Fellows who believe in what we\u2019re building and want to see the Fellowship grow stronger and face deadlier threats.<br><br>Your support directly fuels the continued development of the game, future Heroes, more Dungeons, and new updates for all who fight for the Fellowship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In return, you\u2019ll receive this exclusive collection of cosmetic treasures which will never be available by any other means!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Exile\u2019s Supporter Pack includes:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meiko\u2019s Purifier's Raiments Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082970/extras/0fb43fbb470b083ab2b7a3e1f225cb0a.poster.avif?t=1760630183\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082970/extras/0fb43fbb470b083ab2b7a3e1f225cb0a.webm?t=1760630183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082970/extras/0fb43fbb470b083ab2b7a3e1f225cb0a.mp4?t=1760630183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ardeos\u2019s Null Disciple Ensemble</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082970/extras/59487a1b5b306be39f9af9a07ed31f6a.poster.avif?t=1760630183\" width=1170 h